[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m We find the pairs \((a, d)\) such that:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m \[ 3^a \times 2^d \equiv 1 \mod 5 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m The valid pairs are:
