[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m - \(a = 1, d = 1\): \(3 \times 2 = 6 \equiv 1 \mod 5\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m - \(a = 4, d = 0\): \(81 \times 1 = 81 \equiv 1 \mod 5\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m 
