[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m We need \(3^b \times 7^d \equiv 1 \pmod{5}\). Since \(7 \equiv 2 \pmod{5}\), we need \(3^b \times 2^d \equiv 1 \pmod{5}\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m Analyzing the powers:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m - \(3^b \pmod{5}\) cycles as \(1, 3, 4, 2, 1\)
