[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m Checking the conditions for each \(b\) and \(d\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m - For \(d = 0\), \(3^b \equiv 1 \pmod{5}\) gives \(b = 0, 4\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m - For \(d = 1\), \(3^b \times 2 \equiv 1 \pmod{5}\) gives \(b = 1\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m Thus, the valid pairs are \((b, d) = (0, 0)\), \((4, 0)\), and \((1, 1)\). The corresponding divisors are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m - \(3^0 \times 7^0 = 1\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=107890)[0m - \(3^4 \times 7^0 = 81\)
